{"name": "The Walking Trade", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Walking Trade</strong> is a quirky, action-packed zombie apocalypse store management game where chaos and commerce collide!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/f21922d02f4fb021cec12e6aa2c2527f.avif?t=1787566527\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your shop, balancing space, aesthetics, and functionality. Organize shelves, set prices, and ensure customers leave happy - or at least alive.<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.poster.avif?t=1787566527\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.webm?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.mp4?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/dcadb8da1a15837382751338d21801cc.avif?t=1787566527\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customers aren\u2019t your only problem - zombies invade! Wield melee weapons, firearms, or whatever you can find to defend your shop during raids and hordes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.poster.avif?t=1787566527\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.webm?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.mp4?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><i></i><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/8183750a24a4d98b505669c948747757.avif?t=1787566527\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire survivors to scavenge supplies, serve customers, or guard the shop. Keep them equipped and motivated to reap the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/4a80ee65da96bee17680283c7af3f709.poster.avif?t=1787566527\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/4a80ee65da96bee17680283c7af3f709.webm?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/4a80ee65da96bee17680283c7af3f709.mp4?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/0d5d6aeabc5c2ebc16f9798231075484.avif?t=1787566527\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock crafting stations to create weapons, tools, and shop upgrades. Build barricades, storage units, and even makeshift traps to keep zombies at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.poster.avif?t=1787566527\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.webm?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.mp4?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/40aba1f6b1e5a83b1ec656a53c2bdc69.avif?t=1787566527\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a benevolent shopkeeper or an opportunistic overlord. Help the community, price gouge, or even sabotage settlements for profit. Your reputation determines who comes knocking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.poster.avif?t=1787566527\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.webm?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.mp4?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><i></i><br/>In <strong>The Walking Trade</strong>, every decision shapes your survival. Build, fight, and thrive in the apocalypse\u2014your way!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Run a shop in the zombie apocalypse! Trade batteries, craft stock, manage your staff, and fend off undead hordes. Will you be a hero, or profit at any cost? Your choices shape your store - and your fate.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/2244b05e1dcca28000c8bda123be64b333b0e2ad/header.jpg?t=1787566527", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Management", "Economy", "Post-apocalyptic", "Sandbox", "Building"], "developers": "Microwave Games", "publishers": "Microwave Games", "release_date": "Mar 5, 2026", "price": "$11.99", "appid": "3398110", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "5 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/IZd68lbyuho", "first_seen": 1772665200.0, "review_rank": 1075}